# decisions.md

Rejected approaches and non-obvious tradeoffs — the questions *likely to be
re-argued*, each with a recorded reason (measurement / incident). This is what stops
you from re-proposing, re-trying, and re-discovering the same dead end. Supersede,
don't delete (see the skill's `supersede-trail.md`).

